name idxlayout
category Package
revision 25821
shortdesc Configurable index layout, responsive to KOMA-Script and memoir
relocated 1
longdesc The idxlayout package offers a key-value interface to configure
longdesc index layout parameters, e.g. allowing for three-column indexes
longdesc or for "parent" items and their affiliated subitems being
longdesc typeset as a single paragraph. The package is responsive to the
longdesc index-related options and commands of the KOMA-Script and
longdesc memoir classes.
runfiles size=2
